title: F5OS Platform Memory Utilization
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/f5
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the platform memory utilization of an F5 Networks rSeries appliance
 running F5OS. Reports used, free, available, and total memory in bytes, plus
 the percentage used. Thresholds apply to the used percentage.

discovery:
 One service is created per device.
